        "subject": "feat(0135): pay a waiting store from its status; correct before confirmation; admin sees the latest revision",
        "body": "feat(0135): pay a waiting store from its status; correct before confirmation; admin sees the latest revision\n\n- Owner portal: a waiting store's status opens its payment: the server's\n  price per period, each payment number with its copy button, the number paid\n  from and the screenshot; then 'Waiting for confirmation', where the number\n  or the screenshot can be corrected (sent with the revision it corrects).\n- An activation message's link opens that store's payment (kept in memory,\n  never read from the address).\n- Admin console: shows the number paid from and a correction notice; every\n  approve or refuse sends the revision shown; a stale one reloads the proof.\n- Store wording in EN, FR and AR (store / boutique / al-matjar).\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n",
